getrandom 0.4.3 from crates.io, plus a `keyos` backend (src/backends/keyos.rs and its branch in
src/backends.rs) that delegates to the SDK's patched getrandom 0.2 (hardware TRNG). Needed because
rand 0.10 (imageproc, tract) and uuid (cashu) use getrandom 0.4, which has no Xous backend and only
selects custom backends via RUSTFLAGS, which the foundation CLI owns.
